## Core Development Principles

@architectural_principles [
  {
    "principle": "SOLID",
    "description": "Single Responsibility, Open/Closed, Liskov Substitution, Interface Segregation, Dependency Inversion",
    "enforcement": "mandatory"
  },
  {
    "principle": "Clean Architecture",
    "description": "Clear separation of concerns, domain-driven design, independence from frameworks",
    "enforcement": "mandatory"
  },
  {
    "principle": "DRY/KISS/YAGNI",
    "description": "Don't Repeat Yourself, Keep It Simple Stupid, You Aren't Gonna Need It",
    "enforcement": "mandatory"
  },
